lrich S.", "affiliation": "Jena University"}, {"name": "Dietzek, Benjamin", "affiliation": "Jena University"}, {"name": "Rau, Sven", "affiliation": "Ulm University"}, {"name": "Streb, Carsten", "affiliation": "Ulm University"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "5533868"}}]}, "notes": "Funding statement: U.S.S., S.R., B.D. and C.S. gratefully acknowledge the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft DFG for financial support through the TRR234 \"CataLight (project no: 364549901, projects A1, A4, A5, B1, B6 and Z2). Funding by the Federal State of Baden-W\u00fcrttemberg and Ulm University for a PhD fellowship (LGFG, S.K.) and a Margarete von Wrangell fellowship (M.A.) is acknowledged."}, "title": "Experimental source data for \"A photosensitiser-polyoxometalate dyad that enables the decoupling of light- and dark-reactions for delayed on-demand solar hydrogen production\"", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5533869", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/5533869", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/5533869?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5533869", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5533869", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.5533869", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5533869/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5533868", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/5533868", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5533868", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.5533868", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:5533869/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:5533869/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5533869/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5533869/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/